        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/theta_sigma/{size}/1929_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-17T16:21:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For those who are wondering how I get the different dances, during character creation you are able to set a character's Personality. This defines their stance and a few of their emotes, the most obvious being /dance. Some of the others that change are /wave and /rest, but they're far less fun.</p><p>Ra has the Powerful Personality, Absolute Zero doesn't dance because he is Serious, and Apostate is Primal.</p><p>Some of the dances also are affected by gender and personality together, but I don't remember which ones.</p>",
